# Afrikaans (af) shell command-line / scroll-field prompts (CR-NR-103 Task 10).
# REVIEWED POC locale. The "Command ===>" / "SCROLL ===>" prompts and the SCROLL
# verb + PAGE/HALF/CSR/MAX/DATA/n keyword list stay English (command surface,
# Req 4.2); only prose around them localises. { $arg } is DATA.

ff-desktop-shell-commandline-command-prompt = Command ===>
ff-desktop-shell-commandline-scroll-prompt = SCROLL ===>
ff-desktop-shell-commandline-scroll-invalid = SCROLL: '{ $arg }' is nie 'n geldige rolhoeveelheid nie (PAGE/HALF/CSR/MAX/DATA/n)
